  lockedText: Maybe you're missing someperson?
  offerText: I've eaten raw fish all week. Cook one for me, would you? Bring it on
    a plate.
  reminderText: (Still dreaming of that cooked fish.)
  exactText: "You know, evil is actually a necessary form of existence, isn't it?
    But then again, it's not like we have to become better tomorrow, right? Thank
    you so much\u2014thank you from the very bottom of my heart."
  extraText: I really wish I could go to the beach too.
